       ↓
RAG Retrieval Pipeline
       ↓
Multi-Agent Orchestration
       ↓
LLM Reasoning Engine
       ↓
Risk Decisioning
       ↓
Execution Layer (IAM / DLP / SOAR)
       ↓
Audit + Governance Logging
```

