# LLM + RAG Reasoning Flow

The reasoning engine combines:
- LLM orchestration
- Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG)
- MITRE ATT&CK correlation
- Deterministic enterprise context
- Structured output validation

## RAG Sources
- Security knowledge bases
- Incident history
- IAM policies
- Asset inventories
- Threat intelligence
- Compliance policies
- Access patterns
- Cloud audit logs

## Structured Outputs
The system generates:
- Risk scores
- Investigation summaries
- Attack chain analysis
- Recommended actions
- Confidence levels
- Explainable reasoning traces

---

# Problem Statement

Security Operations Centers (SOCs) generate massive volumes of alerts across:
- SIEM
- EDR
- IAM
- CASB
- DLP
- Cloud platforms

Most systems detect threats but lack:
- Context-aware reasoning
- Identity-centric enforcement
- Explainable AI decisions
- Structured investigation workflows
- Full compliance traceability

This project creates a governed reasoning layer on top of existing SOC infrastructure.

