# Example Technology Stack

| Domain | Technologies |
|---|---|
| SIEM | Splunk, Sentinel, QRadar |
| EDR | CrowdStrike, Defender |
| IAM | Okta, Entra ID, Ping |
| LLMs | GPT, Claude, Llama |
| RAG | Vector databases + enterprise knowledge |
| SOAR | Cortex XSOAR, Tines |
| Governance | OPA, RBAC, policy engines |

